*> PLB-Q001 sql-table-undeclared: FOR UPDATE of a cursor names no
*> table.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FORUPDT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE ACCOUNT TABLE (ACCT_ID INTEGER NOT NULL) END-EXEC.
01  WS-ID               PIC S9(9) COMP.
    *> Not reported: the END-EXEC after FOR UPDATE is no table.
    EXEC SQL
        DECLARE ACCT-CUR CURSOR FOR
            SELECT ACCT_ID FROM ACCOUNT FOR UPDATE
    END-EXEC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL FETCH ACCT-CUR INTO :WS-ID END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL UPDATE ACCOUNT SET ACCT_ID = :WS-ID WHERE CURRENT OF ACCT-CUR
    END-EXEC
    *> Reported: a table with no DECLARE TABLE.
    EXEC SQL UPDATE HISTORY SET HIST_ID = :WS-ID END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    STOP RUN.
